WEBVTT

00:04.087 --> 00:05.130
I...

00:06.131 --> 00:08.884
It's my weakness that's in the way.

00:15.641 --> 00:18.310
Why was I even born?

00:18.810 --> 00:23.065
Was there any iota of reason
for my existence?

00:23.690 --> 00:27.194
In the end, there's nothing I can do.

00:27.861 --> 00:30.239
There's nothing I achieved.

00:30.239 --> 00:32.449
This is the end for me.

00:33.116 --> 00:35.744
I sure lived the worst life, didn't I?

00:36.870 --> 00:39.164
I lived my life treated like rubbish.

00:39.164 --> 00:43.210
Now I've met my demise, also like rubbish.

00:48.215 --> 00:53.178
I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself

00:53.178 --> 00:58.016
I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle

00:58.016 --> 01:07.776
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

01:07.776 --> 01:12.531
A fleeting dream I had is falling now

01:12.531 --> 01:16.910
The loneliness remains as my power

01:17.786 --> 01:21.707
To a life that is drifting away

01:21.707 --> 01:24.918
The magic sprinkles upon

01:26.336 --> 01:31.091
I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them

01:31.091 --> 01:35.762
I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart

01:35.762 --> 01:38.015
See the world through my eyes

01:38.015 --> 01:40.350
And you'll get your treasure

01:40.350 --> 01:45.856
Let's go around the world and find it out

01:47.065 --> 01:51.445
I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself

01:51.903 --> 01:56.450
Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far

01:56.450 --> 02:01.455
Because you have given it to me

02:01.455 --> 02:08.253
I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good

02:21.391 --> 02:25.145
Die, you filthy rat!

02:36.014 --> 02:37.741
Violent Breaking Slash!

02:41.787 --> 02:42.371
Tch!

02:42.954 --> 02:44.706
Jolene, how's your spell going?

02:44.706 --> 02:45.791
Almost there!

02:50.879 --> 02:52.255
Fireball!

02:59.137 --> 03:00.806
One and done.

03:00.806 --> 03:02.265
That's my skill for you.

03:02.265 --> 03:04.476
You mean my magic?

03:04.476 --> 03:07.145
Well, we both did our best.

03:07.145 --> 03:09.314
You're right.

03:09.314 --> 03:12.150
Quit dilly-dallying, you're up!

03:12.150 --> 03:13.527
You rubbish picker.

03:15.696 --> 03:19.032
I am not a "rubbish picker". I am Ein.

03:21.076 --> 03:24.621
Man, ain't you useless.

03:24.621 --> 03:27.374
Come on, Zoid.
Cut him some slack.

03:27.374 --> 03:33.078
Unlike us high commoners,
Ein is merely a low commoner.

03:33.080 --> 03:36.675
My apologies, it's just that
there's a lot to carry.

03:37.509 --> 03:40.804
Get to appraising already,
Mister Appraiser.

03:40.804 --> 03:41.596
Okay.

03:42.514 --> 03:47.477
That's right. My job, Appraiser,
is a low common job.

03:49.062 --> 03:53.233
We were given a job by
the light goddess when we were born.

03:53.233 --> 03:55.736
And by darkness goddess, a skill.

03:57.112 --> 04:01.658
While skills can be honed to
acquire various abilities,

04:01.658 --> 04:05.746
jobs are fixed throughout
one's generation and lifetime.

04:07.622 --> 04:11.084
(Rare Class - High Common - Low Common)
The jobs are divided into three ranks.

04:11.084 --> 04:11.580
(Rare Class - High Common - Low Common)

04:11.580 --> 04:12.335
(Rare Class)

04:12.335 --> 04:16.631
(Rare Class)
The top one, Rare Class, is of wealthy
merchants and military strategists.

04:16.631 --> 04:18.175
(Rare Class)
Consists of only a handful of them.

04:18.175 --> 04:19.134
(Rare Class)

04:19.134 --> 04:19.250
The middle one, High Common,
where Zoid and Jolene are,

04:19.250 --> 04:22.679
(High Common)
The middle one, High Common,
where Zoid and Jolene are,

04:22.679 --> 04:25.390
consists of swordsmen and mages.
The combatants.

04:26.683 --> 04:29.644
(Low Common)
Lies at the bottommost is the Low Common.

04:29.644 --> 04:33.064
(Low Common)
It's for the non-combatants
such as farmers or appraisers.

04:35.400 --> 04:40.155
In most cases, jobs are inherited
from one's parents.

04:41.114 --> 04:45.076
However, since the early
loss of my parents,

04:45.076 --> 04:47.287
I wasn't able to inherit the family trade.

04:48.830 --> 04:52.334
So I aimed for another path
a commoner could still choose.

04:52.334 --> 04:54.211
That is the path of an adventurer.

04:55.796 --> 04:57.923
I dreamed of striking a fortune.

05:00.217 --> 05:00.884
Alas...

05:01.885 --> 05:02.928
Appraise.

05:06.680 --> 05:07.265
(Giant Rat Corpse (F)
A deceased Giant Rat.)

05:07.265 --> 05:09.017
(Giant Rat Corpse (F)
A deceased Giant Rat.)
The rarity is F.

05:09.017 --> 05:10.519
(Giant Rat Corpse (F)
A deceased Giant Rat.)
The lowest rank.

05:10.519 --> 05:11.720
(Giant Rat Corpse (F)
A deceased Giant Rat.)

05:11.720 --> 05:13.271
(Giant Rat Teeth (D) – A giant rat's front teeth.
Can be used as weapons or farming tools.)

05:13.271 --> 05:15.565
But its front teeth are rank D.

05:23.365 --> 05:25.033
It won't even budge...

05:25.033 --> 05:28.036
Hey, how long are you gonna take?

05:28.036 --> 05:30.288
Its rigor mortis had set in, so...

05:31.164 --> 05:32.123
Uh...

05:32.749 --> 05:36.670
Would you mind opening its mouth for me?

05:36.670 --> 05:37.671
Say what?!

05:37.671 --> 05:42.384
Why do I have to touch that filthy rat?!

05:42.384 --> 05:47.806
Handling rubbish is a job for
a rubbish picker, isn't that so, Ein?

05:47.808 --> 05:50.227
You rubbish picker!

05:54.271 --> 05:55.146
What's that?

05:55.981 --> 05:57.315
What are you staring at?!

06:00.277 --> 06:05.574
Look, we risked our lives to keep you safe.

06:05.574 --> 06:08.618
The least you could do,
who did nothing but space out,

06:08.618 --> 06:12.289
is to show a bit more gratitude.

06:14.916 --> 06:17.711
I'm terribly... sorry.

06:21.256 --> 06:23.633
This world is not fair.

06:27.929 --> 06:29.931
Yeah, just like that!

06:29.931 --> 06:34.811
Handling rubbish like that
is exactly your job.

06:34.811 --> 06:35.687
Right?

06:37.814 --> 06:39.858
Ew, gross!

06:39.858 --> 06:44.195
You actually stick your hand in
something so filthy... So gross!

06:44.195 --> 06:47.741
Appraisers are really such a crappy job.

06:47.741 --> 06:50.577
I mean, we can just take
this corpse directly to the guild,

06:50.577 --> 06:53.204
and have them appraise it
with magical tools anyway.

06:55.707 --> 06:58.168
They are right.

06:58.168 --> 07:02.213
All I can do is search for
monster materials and strip them.

07:03.632 --> 07:05.592
Merely rummaging through rubbish.

07:06.217 --> 07:09.554
I let you in this party
for only one reason.

07:09.554 --> 07:14.017
It's simply because I didn't want to stuff
this damned corpse into my magic bag.

07:14.017 --> 07:17.646
If you get that, then get to it,
Mister Rubbish Picker.

07:17.646 --> 07:22.233
You heard him. Be thankful,
Mister Rubbish Picker.

07:22.233 --> 07:25.070
Hurry up and let's get going!

07:26.363 --> 07:27.238
Okay.

07:28.782 --> 07:30.951
Even if I'm treated like this,

07:30.951 --> 07:33.244
I can only scavenge
for rubbish or whatever...

07:33.745 --> 07:36.247
just to survive in this world.

07:38.750 --> 07:41.878
My job is to blame.

07:49.010 --> 07:49.886
Look!

07:49.886 --> 07:53.181
Lucky! A hellhound corpse spotted!

07:54.015 --> 07:55.976
Hey, rubbish picker!

07:55.976 --> 07:57.644
Collect the materials.

07:58.353 --> 08:01.147
Um, don't you find it
a bit strange, though?

08:01.731 --> 08:03.066
According to the guild,

08:03.066 --> 08:05.860
this monster shouldn't be
in this dungeon, right?

08:05.860 --> 08:08.154
Quit your yapping!

08:09.447 --> 08:13.118
If you have the time to talk back to me,
then do your job, you trash!

08:13.660 --> 08:14.536
Understood...

08:14.536 --> 08:16.579
We're very lucky!

08:16.579 --> 08:19.791
Hellhound materials can sell
for a high price, right?

08:19.791 --> 08:21.668
Yeah, that's what I heard.

08:21.668 --> 08:23.545
Let's have a drink once
we get back, okay?

08:23.545 --> 08:26.297
Then we can rent an inn after that,
and you know...

08:26.297 --> 08:28.550
Zoid, you naughty boy.

08:30.927 --> 08:32.178
Appraise.

08:32.470 --> 08:34.055
(Hellhound Corpse (C)
A deceased Hellhound.)

08:34.055 --> 08:35.306
(Hellhound Corpse (C)
A deceased Hellhound.)
The material rarity is...

08:35.550 --> 08:36.099
(Hellhound Fang (B)
Material for a high-quality, sharp blade.)

08:36.099 --> 08:37.308
(Hellhound Fang (B)
Material for a high-quality, sharp blade.)
Rank B.

08:37.308 --> 08:38.050
(Hellhound Fang (B)
Material for a high-quality, sharp blade.)

08:40.520 --> 08:42.814
Hey! There's one over there too!

08:42.814 --> 08:44.149
You're right!

08:44.149 --> 08:46.067
Ein! Fetch that one!

08:48.570 --> 08:50.780
No, something is not right!

08:50.780 --> 08:51.781
Huh?

08:51.781 --> 08:55.410
The map from the guild said that
this is a one-way path!

08:55.410 --> 08:57.454
Then the map must be wrong.

08:57.954 --> 09:01.541
Stop chirping about trivial matters to me.

09:01.541 --> 09:05.628
B-But we really should go back now!
I mean it!

09:05.628 --> 09:08.965
Is that so? Then go back on your own.

09:08.965 --> 09:11.926
But leave that backpack behind.

09:12.844 --> 09:14.137
That's a matter of course.

09:14.137 --> 09:16.681
You're disobeying your leader.

09:16.681 --> 09:20.226
Then you're fired. You don't deserve
any money we earned.

09:20.226 --> 09:21.770
No way...

09:21.770 --> 09:24.355
What's it gonna be? Are you coming?

09:24.355 --> 09:27.358
Or are you leaving?

09:30.403 --> 09:34.324
Only a few parties would accept
someone with an unlucky job like mine.

09:34.824 --> 09:37.577
It's my source of income
I've finally found.

09:37.577 --> 09:41.122
If Zoid abandons me here, I...

09:43.416 --> 09:45.710
I understand...

09:45.710 --> 09:47.295
I'll follow you.

09:47.921 --> 09:49.214
Please let me go along.

09:50.298 --> 09:53.051
You should have said that
from the beginning.

09:55.303 --> 09:56.888
This world...

09:57.555 --> 09:58.807
...is unfair!

10:02.602 --> 10:05.855
No way! You must be joking, right?

10:05.855 --> 10:08.233
This is practically a goldmine!

10:08.233 --> 10:09.984
Amazing!

10:09.984 --> 10:13.363
Something is definitely off here, Zoid.

10:13.363 --> 10:17.617
Who do you think killed
this many hellhounds?

10:17.617 --> 10:18.618
Huh?

10:18.618 --> 10:21.996
If it were adventurers like us,

10:21.996 --> 10:24.124
why didn't they collect the materials?

10:24.124 --> 10:26.501
Shut up! I've had enough.

10:27.877 --> 10:30.588
Z-Zoid, behind you....

10:30.588 --> 10:31.297
What?

10:40.765 --> 10:43.059
What is going on?

10:43.059 --> 10:44.519
No way...

10:44.519 --> 10:47.063
All the corpses we've seen up until now...

10:47.063 --> 10:50.775
...were from packs that fought each other.

10:54.028 --> 10:55.280
What do we do?!

10:55.780 --> 10:59.242
I'm not sure if we can beat even one...

10:59.242 --> 11:02.245
The only choice is to run away.

11:02.245 --> 11:06.040
Against them, no matter how many
lives we have, we won't win.

11:06.040 --> 11:08.751
Run away? How?

11:11.462 --> 11:12.714
Jolene.

11:12.714 --> 11:13.673
What?

11:13.673 --> 11:15.675
Cast a paralysis spell...

11:16.384 --> 11:18.428
...on Ein.

11:18.428 --> 11:20.930
What?! What are you saying?

11:21.890 --> 11:23.391
I see.

11:24.058 --> 11:26.436
Sorry, Ein.

11:26.436 --> 11:29.522
I don't want to die just yet.

11:30.315 --> 11:31.316
Paralyze!

11:35.904 --> 11:39.073
The spell's duration isn't that long.

11:39.073 --> 11:41.576
If you're lucky, you might be able to run.

11:41.576 --> 11:43.995
You mongrels!

11:44.913 --> 11:47.248
Your food is right here!

11:49.250 --> 11:50.793
Good luck!

11:50.793 --> 11:52.420
Sorry, Ein.

11:53.338 --> 11:57.508
No. No way! Wait!

11:58.009 --> 11:59.469
Save me!

12:16.819 --> 12:18.905
The pain is making
the paralysis wear off!

12:20.365 --> 12:21.783
Bastards!

12:31.125 --> 12:32.335
Now is my chance!

12:34.921 --> 12:37.048
I have to escape from here!

12:45.473 --> 12:47.642
They've blocked the exit!

12:48.476 --> 12:50.311
They were trying to trap me here?

12:50.979 --> 12:53.481
Damn it! Damn it all!

13:09.455 --> 13:12.542
A dead end? No way...

13:14.996 --> 13:15.878
They're coming!

13:16.337 --> 13:19.590
If I go back, those hellhounds
will eat me, and I'll be dead.

13:21.050 --> 13:24.262
And if I go forward, I'll fall and die.

13:30.893 --> 13:35.315
Whether I get eaten alive
by hellhounds or fall off a cliff...

13:36.441 --> 13:38.109
I'll die either way.

13:39.485 --> 13:42.488
It's because I was born
as an unlucky appraiser.

13:42.989 --> 13:45.033
I wanted to break free from that,

13:45.033 --> 13:48.244
and became an
adventurer to survive.

13:48.828 --> 13:49.912
But, in the end...

13:49.912 --> 13:54.584
Zoid kept making a fool out of me.
He made me bow my head.

13:54.584 --> 13:56.794
Only to be thrown away...

13:57.545 --> 14:02.175
I can't fight back because I'm merely
a good-for-nothing appraiser...

14:02.884 --> 14:03.926
What can I do?

14:04.677 --> 14:06.220
Nothing I can do.

14:06.929 --> 14:08.473
Is there really
nothing I can do?

14:09.223 --> 14:09.932
No...

14:10.725 --> 14:15.355
All of this is because I put the blame
on my job and ran away.

14:16.022 --> 14:18.524
I set my limits as I please...

14:18.524 --> 14:20.443
...without even trying anything.

14:21.444 --> 14:23.946
It's far too late to regret now.

14:25.531 --> 14:29.702
It's my weakness that's in the way...

14:32.747 --> 14:35.166
Why was I even born?

14:35.666 --> 14:39.379
Was there any iota of reason
for my existence?

14:39.921 --> 14:43.800
In the end, there's nothing I can do.

14:44.509 --> 14:46.636
There's nothing I achieved.

14:46.636 --> 14:48.971
This is the end for me.

14:49.764 --> 14:52.975
I sure lived the worst life, didn't I?

14:53.684 --> 14:56.104
I lived my life treated like rubbish.

14:56.104 --> 15:00.691
Now I've met my demise, also like rubbish.

15:45.820 --> 15:47.822
Am I... dreaming?

15:53.119 --> 15:56.414
Huh? Who was that?

16:10.928 --> 16:13.139
Am I... alive?

16:13.139 --> 16:16.434
Wait, my injuries are healed? How?

16:19.479 --> 16:21.564
What a big tree...

16:28.988 --> 16:29.947
Water?

16:31.240 --> 16:32.158
Appraise.

16:32.610 --> 16:34.076
(Yggdrasil Drops (S) – A healing potion that
instantly cures all injuries and illnesses.)

16:34.076 --> 16:36.245
Y-Yggdrasil drops?!
(Yggdrasil Drops (S) – A healing potion that
instantly cures all injuries and illnesses.)

16:36.245 --> 16:36.660
(Yggdrasil Drops (S) – A healing potion that
instantly cures all injuries and illnesses.)

16:37.163 --> 16:38.748
A-Appraise!

16:39.040 --> 16:40.458
(Yggdrasil (S) – A sacred tree that produces
infinite mana. Can grow without sunlight.)

16:40.458 --> 16:41.834
Wow...
(Yggdrasil (S) – A sacred tree that produces
infinite mana. Can grow without sunlight.)

16:41.834 --> 16:45.004
Yggdrasil really exists!

16:47.131 --> 16:50.593
Once, there was Yggdrasil in this world.

16:52.220 --> 16:56.974
The magical energy we use is generated
within our bodies by absorbing mana...

16:56.974 --> 16:58.726
...from the atmosphere.

16:59.977 --> 17:03.231
Yggdrasil is where mana is produced.

17:03.773 --> 17:06.275
Yggdrasil is said to have
withered long ago

17:06.275 --> 17:08.152
and cease to exist.

17:09.237 --> 17:11.864
However, despite its disappearance,

17:11.864 --> 17:14.575
mana somehow keeps existing.

17:15.243 --> 17:19.705
Scholars suggested that
there may be other Yggdrasils.

17:19.705 --> 17:21.874
Thus, a large-scale search was conducted.

17:22.500 --> 17:25.378
However, no matter where they
searched on the surface,

17:25.378 --> 17:27.964
the Yggdrasil was nowhere to be found.

17:28.881 --> 17:31.050
Of course, they couldn't.

17:31.050 --> 17:35.680
No one would've thought that it was in
a dungeon, and in such a deep part of it.

17:38.388 --> 17:40.890
It was you who saved my life.

17:41.233 --> 17:42.443
Thank you.

17:47.650 --> 17:48.651
What was that?

17:51.670 --> 17:53.160
Was I imagining things?

17:54.532 --> 17:57.451
It's awfully quiet here
despite being a dungeon.

17:57.994 --> 18:00.788
No sign of monsters, too.

18:01.539 --> 18:04.792
Well then, what should I do from here on?

18:04.875 --> 18:06.294
Good luck!

18:06.294 --> 18:08.504
Sorry, Ein.

18:08.504 --> 18:11.507
I can't expect them to call for help.

18:12.008 --> 18:14.844
Plus, there's no food here.

18:15.428 --> 18:17.013
If I'm going to starve to death,

18:17.376 --> 18:20.266
I'd rather take a gamble
and try to escape.

18:21.517 --> 18:24.103
Thank you for saving me!

18:24.103 --> 18:26.022
I owe you my gratitude.

18:26.522 --> 18:27.523
See you.

18:35.156 --> 18:37.074
This place isn't even on the map...

18:37.074 --> 18:41.287
Meaning it's an unknown area
that even the guild wasn't aware of.

18:42.371 --> 18:45.791
There might be enemies
stronger than those hellhounds.

18:50.838 --> 18:52.673
Come on, get a grip!

18:52.673 --> 18:55.968
It might be scary, but I have to do this!

18:57.219 --> 19:00.348
I have to carve out
the path for myself!

19:01.223 --> 19:06.729
This time, I'll break my limit
and give everything I have!

19:14.403 --> 19:17.907
There are fewer monsters
than I thought.

19:17.907 --> 19:18.991
That's a relief.

19:19.742 --> 19:22.745
As long as I can find an exit, I can esca—

19:28.709 --> 19:31.962
My ear! It's gone!

19:40.781 --> 19:42.473
A-Appraise!

19:46.140 --> 19:47.470
(Gremlin (S) – A small demon in the
labyrinth. Low attack power but great speed.)

19:47.470 --> 19:48.220
(Tortures prey with a sickle before killing.)

19:48.229 --> 19:50.356
An S rank?!

19:50.356 --> 19:53.359
Those hellhounds were B rank....

20:02.535 --> 20:06.455
Dammit! Even if I find out
my opponent's rank,

20:06.455 --> 20:09.542
I still lack the strength to fight!

20:09.542 --> 20:11.877
I have to run!

20:28.060 --> 20:30.770
(Death Bear (S) – A giant bear in the labyrinth,
known for its strong arms and sharp claws.)

20:30.770 --> 20:32.100
(One fatal blow can
easily shatter boulders.)

20:45.286 --> 20:46.704
My eyes!

21:02.344 --> 21:03.220
This is not good...

21:04.263 --> 21:05.973
It's over...

21:08.017 --> 21:09.518
Good grief.

21:10.853 --> 21:14.106
I'm only here because she begged me to.

21:14.106 --> 21:18.611
That's why I'm helping
a mere human like you.

21:18.611 --> 21:21.614
Don't get the wrong idea, kid.

21:21.614 --> 21:24.700
What? Who are you?

21:30.498 --> 21:31.624
Huh?

21:32.500 --> 21:33.626
Where am I...

21:36.378 --> 21:38.380
My eyes? My injuries?

21:53.010 --> 21:54.215
She's beautiful...

21:55.439 --> 21:58.526
Like something out of a fairy tale.

21:58.927 --> 22:00.778
She's like a fairy...

22:09.662 --> 22:15.000
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:15.000 --> 22:20.005
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:20.005 --> 22:22.424
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.424 --> 22:25.511
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.514 --> 22:30.474
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.476 --> 22:37.231
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.231 --> 22:42.111
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.111 --> 22:47.116
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.116 --> 22:51.912
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.205 --> 22:55.666
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.666 --> 22:57.126
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.126 --> 23:04.008
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.885 --> 23:11.307
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.307 --> 23:15.978
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.978 --> 23:18.647
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.647 --> 23:21.233
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.233 --> 23:26.155
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.155 --> 23:28.574
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.574 --> 23:31.118
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.118 --> 23:31.744
(Even Given)

23:31.744 --> 23:32.328
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.328 --> 23:32.536
(I'm)

23:32.536 --> 23:32.703
(Actually)

23:32.703 --> 23:32.828
(the Strongest)

23:35.938 --> 23:38.820
Next episode:
Divine Appraisal with Spirit's Eye.

23:38.820 --> 23:40.820
(Next episode:
